*server_info*
docs/auth_architecture_spec.md
docs/adr/
deploy_186.py
cmd/release/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*secret*
*credential*

# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. AI 开发与辅助工具生成文件 (开发工作流产物)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/
openspec/
AGENTS.md
CONTEXT.md
.gemini/
.cursor/
.cline/

# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. 编译输出二进制、分发目录与归档备份包
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/
dist/
cli-dist/
release.exe
slimbox.exe
slimbox-tray.exe
slimbox-cli.exe
slimbox-darwin-arm64
slimbox-cli-darwin-arm64
slimbox-linux-amd64
slimbox-linux-arm64
trace_startup_darwin
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.dmg
*.iso

# -------------------------------------------------------------------
